<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-AUXERRE BEAT RANGERS 2-1.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUXERRE BEAT RANGERS 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>AUXERRE, France 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auxerre beat Glasgow</p>
<p>Rangers 2-1 (half-time 2-1) in their European Champions' League</p>
<p>group A match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Auxerre - Lilian Laslandes 20, Steve Marlet 31</p>
<p>Rangers - Richard Gough 34</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
